title: Review and tests
pid: 42a53877-b834-4c86-8baa-18555523bbb9
body: |2-
  A fresh mind reviewed the change against the mission; I mended what it
  found (a false reason when the save also deletes the member, a
  preview's early refusals answered as save-result, a debug snapshot a
  preview wrote, a fork named by its original's title) except the
  withheld-rerender path, above. All of 'bash/all-tests.sh' and
  'tools/skg-for-ai/test_skg_for_ai.py' pass; one test in the server,
  each client and the AI reader fails without the change. Checked
  end to end on a scratch server: the dry run printed the hide and left
  the file alone, the save wrote and printed it, and "verify connection"
  names "save preview".
